{title: SYLVIA'S MOTHER}
{subtitle: Dr. Hook}
  For the (Asus4) - (A) - (Asus4) twinkle in the intro just add your pinky to the 2nd string/3rd fret while holding the (A).  On/off/on/off.  For the (E7) do the same thing - add your pinky to the 2nd string/3rd fret while holding the (E) form.

  For the (DaddA) extend your pinky over to the 1st string of the 5th fret while holding (D).

  For (E/F#) add your pinky to the 1st string/2nd fret while holding the (E).

FUN FACT:  There really was a Sylvia.  Her name was Sylvia Pandolfi who spurned the songwriter, married another, and ended up as a museum curator in Mexico City.  Her mother’s name was Louisa (the surname Avery is fictitious).

